Component: mumps
Description: MUMPS, sequential, double precision real arithmetic only.
Arith: d
Makefile: src/Makefile
Makefile.Vars: OBJS_COMMON_MOD, OBJS_COMMON_OTHER, OBJS_C_COMMON,
 OBJS_MOD_ARITHDEP, OBJS_OTHER
Files: LICENSE, CREDITS, VERSION,
 doc/CeCILL-C_V1-en.txt, doc/CeCILL-C_V1-fr.txt, PORD/README,
 include/dmumps_c.h, include/dmumps_struc.h, include/mumps_c_types.h,
 include/mumps_compat.h,
 src/mumps_int_def32_h.in, src/*.h, src/dmumps_*.h,
 libseq/mpi.f, libseq/mpif.h, libseq/mpi.h, libseq/mpic.c, libseq/elapse.c,
 libseq/elapse.h,
 PORD/include/*.h, PORD/lib/*.c
Exclude: src/smumps_*.h, src/cmumps_*.h, src/zmumps_*.h
Fortran.Headers: include/dmumps_struc.h, libseq/mpif.h, libseq/mpif_const.h,
 src/mumps_headers.h,
 src/mumps_tags.h, src/mumps_save_restore_modes.h
Defines.C: Add_, metis, pord, NO_SAVE_RESTORE, WITHOUT_PTHREAD
Defines.Fortran: metis, pord, NO_SAVE_RESTORE
Defines.Unknown: _WIN32, __GFORTRAN__, __INTEL_COMPILER, __PGLLVM__
Units: *, 6, LP, MP, MPG, MPA, MPRINT, ICNTL1, ICNTL(1), ICNTL(2), ICNTL(3),
 ID%ICNTL(1), CV_LP, CV_MP, IUNIT, OUTINFO, MYID+6, LPOK, PROKG
IO-Disabled: ana_omp_m.F READ_BENCH,
 dana_driver.F DMUMPS_DUMP_PROBLEM,
 dmumps_config_file.F *
RNG: mumps_static_mapping.F MUMPS_MOD_PROPMAP,
 mumps_static_mapping.F MUMPS_PROPMAP,
 dmumps_sol_es.F DMUMPS_PERMUTE_RHS_AM1
Notes: READ_BENCH is made a no-op by patch 0002 (KEEP(403) benchmark files
 are never read). DMUMPS_DUMP_PROBLEM (ICNTL WRITE_PROBLEM) writes nothing.
 The configuration file is never located (patch 0001), so
 DMUMPS_CONFIG_FROM_FILE returns before any I/O.
